# This file provides JVM options for Maven when invoking the Wrapper (./mvnw).
# The mvnw script in this repo ignores comments and blank lines in this file.
#
# IMPORTANT: This project requires Java 21. Ensure JAVA_HOME points to a Java 21 JDK
# (or that `java -version` returns 21) before running `./mvnw`.
#
# If you encounter reflection/module access errors (unlikely with Spring Boot 3.2+),
# you may uncomment one or more of the --add-opens lines below.
# --add-opens=java.base/java.lang=ALL-UNNAMED
# --add-opens=java.base/java.lang.reflect=ALL-UNNAMED
# --add-opens=java.base/java.io=ALL-UNNAMED
# --add-opens=java.base/java.util=ALL-UNNAMED
#
# Example memory settings (optional):
# -Xms256m
# -Xmx512m
